    "detailed_description": "<strong>\u300aFreus\u300b</strong> is a platform action game. Help the demon-possessed boy, Freus, to complete his journey of revenge. Use your strengths to your advantage and let Floys dodge through brutal, fast-paced levels, defeat powerful enemies, and make it to the end!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><br><strong>Fast-paced game mechanics:</strong>Freus is just an ordinary person who will collapse immediately after being attacked, try not to make mistakes, so that Freus can complete his journey unscathed.<br><br><strong>Handcrafted levels:</strong>The game contains more than 100 handcrafted levels, each of which is unique and challenging, which will test your skills!<br><br><strong>An unusual adventure:</strong>Follow in the footsteps of Freus and his friends, go deep into this conspiracy that affects the whole world, and finally decide the direction of the world.<br><br><strong>Pure hand-made pixel art:</strong>All the art materials in the game are drawn by hand, including interesting pixel-style scenes and frame-by-frame animations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1507080/extras/519da06b40e75cd1293b199dc7d5f55e.poster.avif?t=1651781181\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1507080/extras/519da06b40e75cd1293b199dc7d5f55e.apng?t=1651781181\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br><i> Come on with Freus! (huh,if you can...)</i>",
